{
    "title": "Minicraft Crafting Building",
    "description": "Welcome to the infinite voxel world game in the sandbox game genre, do you like building games? Do you like survival games?\r\n\r\nYou will find these two things in Minicraft Crafting Building, you can adventure and build in this game, in this game there are lots of blocks that you can arrange block by block to produce buildings that you like, such as building houses, building buildings, building villages. By using an HD texture pack, this game will look good on the device you use and the game will be better with FPS that you can set yourself. \r\n\r\n<h2>Minicraft Crafting Building features: </h2>\r\nBelow we will explain the features in this game:\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h3>Developing villages </h3>\r\nAfter you create a new world, the game will present a rural atmosphere with life. The village can be a small village with just a few houses or a large village with farms and villagers living at work.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h3>You can build a farm </h3>\r\nYou can build your own house and then you can do farming by clearing land by cutting down some trees to make a farm. You can plant various agricultural crops. To make the land arable, you can use a hoe on your equipment and dig the soil with the hoe, then the land is ready for you to sow plant seeds. You can get plant seeds by searching in your inventory by typing seed. Then choose the seeds you want and scatter them on your agricultural field.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h3>Can build a farm </h3>\r\nNext to your house you can also raise several livestock animals. You must first build a cage for the livestock. To make a cage you can type fence in your inventory and make a cage according to the size you want. then put some animals in the cage and give them food so they can grow healthy.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h3>HD texture pack </h3>\r\nThis game has a high resolution texture pack for a more interesting game for you to play alone or together. With a texture pack, the world you create will be more real with a more comfortable atmosphere and equipped with nature sounds and animals that decorate the world you create.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h3>High FPS in games </h3>\r\nFps in this game has several dropdown options that you can adjust in the settings, so you can adjust it to your desired needs and the availability of your device.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nEnjoy playing and please download <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.hand.craft.omblo.handcraft.survival.adventure\">Minicraft Crafting Building </a> thank you.\r\n",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to the infinite voxel world game in the sandbox game genre, do you like building games? Do you like survival games?<br><br>You will find these two things in Minicraft Crafting Building, you can adventure and build in this game, in this game there are lots of blocks that you can arrange block by block to produce buildings that you like, such as building houses, building buildings, building villages. By using an HD texture pack, this game will look good on the device you use and the game will be better with FPS that you can set yourself. <br><br><h2>Minicraft Crafting Building features: </h2><br>Below we will explain the features in this game:<br><br><br><br><h3>Developing villages </h3><br>After you create a new world, the game will present a rural atmosphere with life. The village can be a small village with just a few houses or a large village with farms and villagers living at work.<br><br><br><br><h3>You can build a farm </h3><br>You can build your own house and then you can do farming by clearing land by cutting down some trees to make a farm. You can plant various agricultural crops. To make the land arable, you can use a hoe on your equipment and dig the soil with the hoe, then the land is ready for you to sow plant seeds. You can get plant seeds by searching in your inventory by typing seed. Then choose the seeds you want and scatter them on your agricultural field.<br><br><br><br><h3>Can build a farm </h3><br>Next to your house you can also raise several livestock animals. You must first build a cage for the livestock. To make a cage you can type fence in your inventory and make a cage according to the size you want. then put some animals in the cage and give them food so they can grow healthy.<br><br><br><br><h3>HD texture pack </h3><br>This game has a high resolution texture pack for a more interesting game for you to play alone or together. With a texture pack, the world you create will be more real with a more comfortable atmosphere and equipped with nature sounds and animals that decorate the world you create.<br><br><br><br><h3>High FPS in games </h3><br>Fps in this game has several dropdown options that you can adjust in the settings, so you can adjust it to your desired needs and the availability of your device.<br><br><br><br>Enjoy playing and please download <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.hand.craft.omblo.handcraft.survival.adventure\">Minicraft Crafting Building </a> thank you.<br>",
